{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queryItems","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"URLQueryItem","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLQueryItem"},{"text":"]? { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLQueryItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represents a single key-value pair,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that a name may appear more than once in a single query string, so the name values are not guaranteed to be unique. If the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has an empty query component, returns an empty array. If the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no query component, returns nil.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The setter combines an array containing any number of ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLQueryItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s, each of which represents a single key-value pair, into a query string and sets the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" query property. Passing an empty array sets the query component of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to an empty string. Passing nil removes the query component of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If a name-value pair in a query is empty (i.e. the query string starts with ‘&’, ends with ‘&’, or has “&&” within it), you get a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLQueryItem"},{"text":" with a zero-length name and a nil value. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing before the equals sign, you get a zero-length name. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing after the equals sign, you get a zero-length value. If a query’s name-value pair has no equals sign, the query name-value pair string is the name and you get a nil value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLComponents"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"queryItems","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials13URLComponentsV10queryItemsSayAA12URLQueryItemVGSgvp","modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queryItems","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"URLQueryItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"text":"The query subcomponent as an array of URLQueryItems.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLangu